<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">
<%- include("partials/head", {title: "enhive | about", styles:
  "/styles/about.css"}) %>

  <body>
  <%- include("partials/nav", {activePage: "about"}) %>
    <main>
      <section>
        <div class="heading">
          <h1>About us</h1>
          <p>Find out more about enhive and the team.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="story-section">
        <div>
          <h2>Our story</h2>
          <div class="description">
            <p>
              It all started with a simple weekend dilemma – finding the perfect
              activity to enjoy with friends and family. Back in 2018, our
              founders were tired of spending hours searching different websites
              and making countless phone calls just to plan a fun day out. There
              had to be a better way.
            </p>
            <p>
              That's when <strong>enhive</strong> was born. We envisioned a
              single platform where people could discover, compare, and book
              amazing leisure experiences with just a few clicks. What began as
              a small team working from a garage has now grown into the region's
              most trusted leisure booking platform.
            </p>
            <p>
              Today, we partner with over 500 venues – from bowling alleys and
              escape rooms to adventure parks and mini golf courses. Our mission
              remains simple: to make planning your next great adventure as
              exciting as the adventure itself. We believe life's best moments
              happen when we step away from our screens and dive into real
              experiences with the people we care about.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong
                >Ready to discover your next adventure? Let's make it happen.
              </strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img alt="enhive founders" src="/images/founders.png" class="image" />
      </section>
      <section class="mission-section">
        <div>
          <h2>Our mission</h2>
          <div class="description">
            <p>
              At enhive, our mission is to transform how people discover and
              experience leisure activities. We exist to eliminate the friction
              between wanting to have fun and actually having it – turning the
              tedious task of planning into an exciting journey of discovery.
            </p>
            <p>
              We believe that every person deserves easy access to memorable
              experiences that enrich their lives, strengthen relationships, and
              create lasting memories. By connecting adventurers with incredible
              venues and activities in their community, we're not just
              facilitating bookings – we're fostering connections, supporting
              local businesses, and helping people live more fulfilling lives.
            </p>
            <p>
              Our commitment extends beyond convenience. We strive to be the
              bridge that brings communities together, one booking at a time.
              When you choose LeisureLink, you're not just planning an activity
              – you're investing in local businesses, creating jobs, and
              contributing to a vibrant leisure ecosystem that benefits
              everyone.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong
                >We're here to make every adventure accessible, every booking
                effortless, and every experience unforgettable.</strong
              >
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img
          alt="enhive employees in a planning session"
          src="/images/mission.png"
          class="image"
        />
      </section>
    </main>
  <%- include("partials/footer") %>
  </body>

</html>